From 35808780a6696b77977ca205686ac10c10839961 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sander van der Heijden <sheijden@Sanders-Mini.vdh.lan>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 07:04:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cluster-health): declare HA_NOTIFY_TARGET in Git, not
 1Password

health-notify has failed every day since 2026-07-12 (HTTP 400 from HA,
CronJob lastSuccessfulTime 2026-07-11T06:00:11Z). It posted to
notify.mobile_app_s25_ultra_sander, which does not exist in HA.

The stale name was not baked into the image, as inc-2026-08-27-001
recorded. /scripts is overridden by the cluster-health-scripts ConfigMap
and that notify.py reads the target from env only. The CronJob had no
explicit HA_NOTIFY_TARGET and inherited it via envFrom from
cluster-health-secret, which the ExternalSecret populated from the
1Password item property HA_NOTIFY_TARGET. A non-secret device id living
in 1Password silently overrode a repo that read correctly, which is why
the July remediation of inc-2026-07-23-001 missed this call site.

- declare HA_NOTIFY_TARGET explicitly on health-notify (env beats envFrom)
- drop the HA_NOTIFY_TARGET mapping from the ExternalSecret so the value
  can no longer be overridden from outside Git

Verified against live HA: /api/services domain notify lists
mobile_app_galaxy_s25_ultra and does not list mobile_app_s25_ultra_sander.
A one-off Job cloned from the live CronJob with the corrected env returned
HTTP 200 and exit 0 (chg-2026-09-07-002, evidence T2).

Refs: inc-2026-08-27-001, chg-2026-09-07-002

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YHy4ig5fAThHHo4JXY6vJ7
---
 .../observability/cluster-health/app/cronjobs.yaml    | 11 +++++++++++
 .../cluster-health/app/externalsecret.yaml            | 11 +++++++----
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/kubernetes/main/apps/observability/cluster-health/app/cronjobs.yaml b/kubernetes/main/apps/observability/cluster-health/app/cronjobs.yaml
index 4e0d9bf..0f2e157 100644
--- a/kubernetes/main/apps/observability/cluster-health/app/cronjobs.yaml
+++ b/kubernetes/main/apps/observability/cluster-health/app/cronjobs.yaml
@@ -264,6 +264,17 @@ spec:
                   value: http://home-assistant.home-automation.svc.cluster.local:8123
                 - name: REPORT_BASE_URL
                   value: https://health.${SECRET_DOMAIN}
+                # Declared HERE, in Git, on purpose. This is a device id, not
+                # a secret. It used to arrive only via envFrom from the
+                # 1Password item, where a stale value
+                # (mobile_app_s25_ultra_sander) silently overrode a repo that
+                # read correctly and broke the 08:00 digest push for 57 days
+                # (inc-2026-08-27-001 / chg-2026-09-07-002). An explicit env
+                # entry takes precedence over envFrom, so Git now wins. The
+                # value must match a service that really exists in HA under
+                # `GET /api/services` domain notify.
+                - name: HA_NOTIFY_TARGET
+                  value: mobile_app_galaxy_s25_ultra
               envFrom:
                 # Optional so the CronJob can run before the 1Password item
                 # exists. notify.py / git_push.py / collect_ha.py all degrade
diff --git a/kubernetes/main/apps/observability/cluster-health/app/externalsecret.yaml b/kubernetes/main/apps/observability/cluster-health/app/externalsecret.yaml
index 8d777b5..4bf0271 100644
--- a/kubernetes/main/apps/observability/cluster-health/app/externalsecret.yaml
+++ b/kubernetes/main/apps/observability/cluster-health/app/externalsecret.yaml
@@ -20,10 +20,13 @@ spec:
       remoteRef:
         key: cluster-health
         property: HA_LONG_LIVED_TOKEN
-    - secretKey: HA_NOTIFY_TARGET
-      remoteRef:
-        key: cluster-health
-        property: HA_NOTIFY_TARGET
+    # HA_NOTIFY_TARGET is deliberately NOT pulled from 1Password any more.
+    # It is a device id, not a credential, and sourcing it here made it
+    # invisible in Git: a stale 1P value (mobile_app_s25_ultra_sander)
+    # silently won over a repo that read correctly and killed the 08:00
+    # digest push for 57 days (inc-2026-08-27-001 / chg-2026-09-07-002).
+    # Any CronJob that needs it now declares it as a plain env var.
+    # Do not re-add it here.
     - secretKey: UNIFI_API_KEY
       remoteRef:
         key: cluster-health
-- 
2.50.1 (Apple Git-155)

